  "description": "Cross-platform audio engine for .NET mobile apps (Android, iOS), built on a native Rust core. Playback, recording, multi-track mixing, effects, VST3 hosting, matchering and the Avalonia waveform display, without the ONNX-based analysis features (no chord detection, no note transcription). AOT-compatible and trimmable.",
